ParaRead Android modifications (2026):
------------------------------------
- Kotlin/Compose tablet host, SAF immutable snapshots and native range reads.
- Room document/page/translation/reading caches and durable whole-document jobs.
- OpenAI-compatible and llama.cpp JNI providers, validation and cancellation.
- Default GGUF download/import/deletion and configurable CPU inference threads.
- Modified TS: main.ts, panel.ts, pdfjs.d.ts, pointer-select.ts, save-bridge.ts,
  sentence-store.ts, translation-client.ts, messages.ts and tsconfig.json.
  Changes cover Android bootstrap/messages, touch input, bounded state,
  streamed drafts, cache integration, reading restoration and durable jobs.
- Generated PDF.js worker: sparse byte ranges and incremental suffix saving.
- Generated PDF.js viewer/HTML: bounded page buffer, native bootstrap, local
  assets, CSP and tablet layout; original copyright headers are retained.
- Source: Chuanyunux/pararead@c9d103481e4e3fa065cee6a52e611b8be20866c6.
  Patches and asset generation: scripts/patch_pdfjs.mjs, scripts/build_reader.mjs.

